{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國司法部周四公佈，美方執法部門已扣押上月從加密貨幣交易所幣安被盜、價值約 12 億美元的虛擬資產；同時美方表態將打擊網絡詐騙活動。10 月 29 日加密巨頭幣安遭遇黑客攻擊，被盜資產總額超 60 億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586300.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:22:48.548789+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T14:11:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:15:58.620331+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T14:15:58.620331+00:00","content_hash":"f3b5dd423887b63a65d1a32ba007a28aa7781ea00778676a33a5084637bf0fb8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}